      "initial": "50% synthetic signed-in accounts / 50% guests (rounded by fixed 10-actor blocks); 80% Daily across mixed, powered-cube and latest, 20% entitled practice with rerolls; eight paced view/pick pairs, score/share/eligibility checks, boards and account-attachment cohort",
